# Go source must stay LF in the working tree.
#
# With core.autocrlf=true, Git rewrites LF -> CRLF on checkout, so the working
# copy diverges from the repository (which stores LF). gofmt reads the working
# copy, so it reports every CRLF file as unformatted and produces a whole-file
# diff that changes nothing but line endings. eol=lf overrides autocrlf for
# these files.
*.go text eol=lf
